          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A witness reports their filmed observations. These are two observations (on 27/10/2009 and 13/11/2009) made by the same witness from the same location. Both observations describe white threads in the sky (plane trails and/or atmospheric trails) and the observation of 'black balls' crossing the sky at high speed (bird or insect flights, or objects in the foreground of the video sent by the witness to GEIPAN). Without gendarmerie reports or other investigation elements, these two cases are classified B as the probable observation of entirely natural phenomena.",
